1
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:18,420
Aiming for the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:23,920
kicking a pebble, leaping like a bear,

3
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:29,240
to Shibamata, the type who was out jogging,

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,820
they laughed at me for
staying just as full of energy.

5
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:36,140
Where's the good energy?

6
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,680
Even as a sound, it's solid and strong.

7
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,940
A nightmare, one unchanging street scene,

8
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,880
is gentler still.

9
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,020
Because the crows are cawing,

10
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:48,700
the sun has already set.

11
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,940
Stuffing ourselves with yakitori,

12
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,860
will we see it?

13
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,500
Of the pointed hats,

14
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:04,060
from the people to the Daishakuden,
the sunset falls.

15
00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:10,080
You'll lose it again tomorrow, won't you?

16
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:12,800
Is it a magazine?
"Happiness again," they say.

17
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,300
Because I'm a fool who only
realized after losing it.

18
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:47,240
Eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeh!

19
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:50,820
Getting pretty hot and heavy At this rate, you
probably want to be together every day, don't you?

20
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:52,960
Well, yeah.

21
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,640
Chief, did something good happen today?

22
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:57,560
Nah, nothing special.

23
00:01:57,740 --> 00:02:00,100
You seem happy today, Chief.

24
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,040
Do I?

25
00:02:02,540 --> 00:02:04,120
It's just your imagination, Reiko.

26
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:06,340
Helping you with building a home?

27
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:10,282
For you, who are considering
a remodel into a gitai house,

28
00:02:10,332 --> 00:02:11,520
Free estimates.

29
00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:12,420
Give it back.

30
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:16,120
Are you really going to
make it a gitai house, Chief?

31
00:02:17,580 --> 00:02:20,320
Talking to you is going to ruin my mood.

32
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:22,760
Work hard and honestly today, too.

33
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,340
Got it?

34
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,280
Then I'm counting on you.

35
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:25,560
Yes.

36
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,920
Something's off about the Chief.

37
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:29,660
I see.

38
00:02:29,660 --> 00:02:33,500
The Chief's remodeling it into a two-generation
house so he can live with his grandkids.

39
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,160
I see.

40
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:36,240
So that's why he looked so happy.

41
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:38,200
So that's what it was.

42
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:40,660
What do you mean, "that's what it was"?

43
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:41,740
Ryo-san.

44
00:02:41,740 --> 00:02:43,780
Ryo-san, help me.

45
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:46,880
What's wrong, Kiyama's old man?

46
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:50,060
There's no work.
Are we really going under this time?

47
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:54,660
A carpenter's job is building houses, right?
What's the point of tearing them down?

48
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:57,720
I'm saying I want to build,
but nobody's ordering anything.

49
00:02:58,060 --> 00:03:00,120
Then I guess going under can't be helped.

50
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:00,920
That's terrible.

51
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:03,860
Ryo-chan,
don't you think that attitude is a bit much?

52
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,480
Here you go.

53
00:03:05,660 --> 00:03:06,640
S-sorry.

54
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:09,924
Well, just look at the shopping street,
the houses across and on either side of it.

55
00:03:09,974 --> 00:03:12,380
There aren't any thriving shops, are there?

56
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,540
If we all go under together,
there's nothing to be scared of.

57
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:16,620
Quit it, quit it!

58
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:17,740
Just call it off.

59
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:19,940
Ryo-chan

60
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,580
I'm kidding, I'm just kidding.

61
00:03:22,580 --> 00:03:26,920
Ryo-san has a track record of hitting
it big with a string of businesses.

62
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:29,080
How do I get my luck to turn back around?

63
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,680
Tell me.

64
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,180
Please, I'm begging you.

65
00:03:32,180 --> 00:03:33,720
Stop it.

66
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,160
Alright, I get it.

67
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,180
I'll do something about it.

68
00:03:36,620 --> 00:03:37,640
Ryo-san.

69
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:43,320
First, we'll remodel this shop.

70
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,300
Remodel?

71
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:47,020
Remodeling is booming like never before.

72
00:03:47,020 --> 00:03:47,320
Yeah.

73
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:49,500
We'll make it a stylish design office.

74
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:52,520
We'll bait in new customers
with something they can't resist.

75
00:03:52,520 --> 00:03:57,080
And you yourself will be remodeled
from a craftsman into a creator.

76
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,460
Remodeling

77
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,920
Feels kinda unsettling

78
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,000
Dressed like this.

79
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:09,280
People definitely laughed at us, Ryo-san.

80
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,060
That was a friendly laugh.

81
00:04:11,060 --> 00:04:13,220
It's fine, you look pretty sharp.

82
00:04:13,620 --> 00:04:14,700
Really?

83
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,100
Listen carefully.

84
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:19,480
Even with dissonance,
designer apartments and stylish appliances

85
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:22,480
Things that pay attention to
appearance are definitely selling.

86
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:25,360
The same goes for people on
the front lines of business.

87
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,240
So that's why we're in these clothes.

88
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,580
Thinking about the balance as a duo,

89
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:32,880
I'll go with the friendly salesman look.

90
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,720
Got it.

91
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,980
Ah, then it's right nearby.

92
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:39,200
Here, here, over this way!

93
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:42,100
Hello~, we're coming right now!

94
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:43,980
Yes, we'll be waiting~!

95
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:45,060
W-what is it?

96
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,357
Through a connection,

97
00:04:46,407 --> 00:04:50,140
we managed to get featured on
"Terebi 3-ji no Okusan" safely.

98
00:04:50,140 --> 00:04:50,680
Nyeh!

99
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:53,601
No matter how skilled you are
and how much better you look,

100
00:04:53,651 --> 00:04:55,700
customers won't come unless you advertise,
you know.

101
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,560
This is my first time on TV, so I'm nervous.

102
00:04:58,900 --> 00:05:01,440
Don't worry, leave everything to me.

103
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:05,900
Overriding Mom's objections and spending all our retirement savings,
this is a fresh start!

104
00:05:05,900 --> 00:05:09,680
I'll work my hardest too.
I'm counting on you, Ryo-san.

105
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:10,820
Leave it to me.

106
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:13,140
But my fee is fifty-fifty, okay?

107
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:13,960
Hello.

108
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:19,860
Hello, I'm Ryotsu, in charge of
PR and sales for Kiyama Remodeling.

109
00:05:19,860 --> 00:05:20,400
Whoa.

110
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:23,920
I've seen your remodeling work
on Sanji's wife's home many times.

111
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,560
I'm looking forward to
something interesting.

112
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:26,960
So you're the president?

113
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:29,120
Yes, I'm the owner and head designer.

114
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:31,080
Kiyama Woodworks.

115
00:05:31,580 --> 00:05:32,440
Dapyon!

116
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:36,860
Alright, the client is already standing by on site,
so let's head out.

117
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:39,960
Action!

118
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:43,400
I'm Yamanaka, I run the landlord business here.
I'm Yamanaka.

119
00:05:43,900 --> 00:05:46,520
Thirty years old, no bath, with a toilet.

120
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:48,760
Four-and-a-half-mat rooms,
ten units in total.

121
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:52,540
Lately, even when we lower the rent,
we can't find tenants.

122
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:55,500
Without an element of surprise,
we won't get ratings.

123
00:05:55,940 --> 00:05:57,780
With this,
it might be hard to get it on air.

124
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,920
Ryo-san, what should we do?

125
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,740
I've got a secret weapon up my sleeve.

126
00:06:06,820 --> 00:06:08,920
On top of this Heisei recession,

127
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:10,980
we had been at our wits' end.

128
00:06:10,980 --> 00:06:14,440
Regarding Kiyama
Remodeling's renewal campaign,

129
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,080
thank you very much for applying.

130
00:06:17,020 --> 00:06:18,180
Hello.

131
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:22,460
Mr. Yamanaka,
as our very first commemorative customer,

132
00:06:22,460 --> 00:06:25,980
we'll gladly accept the remodel you want,
specially and nicely.

133
00:06:25,980 --> 00:06:27,900
How about it? Good, right?

134
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:29,000
Yeah, good!

135
00:06:29,700 --> 00:06:33,120
I can't believe they'd
remodel this place for us!

136
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:37,220
It would help us a lot if you
could make it around 100,000 yen.

137
00:06:37,220 --> 00:06:38,300
W-wait a minute.

138
00:06:38,300 --> 00:06:41,400
Remodeling a whole apartment
building for 100,000 yen?

139
00:06:41,780 --> 00:06:44,240
I've never heard of such a thing in my life.

140
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,680
Please, hold on a moment.

141
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,300
Yes.

142
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:47,000
Well then, just a moment.

143
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:49,600
That's exactly why we're doing this.

144
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,200
You said you'd work your butt off,
didn't you?

145
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,360
This is advertising.

146
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:54,320
Show some enthusiasm in front of the camera.

147
00:06:56,180 --> 00:06:58,440
Right now, the first 30 customers only!

148
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,740
We're now accepting remodeling orders.

149
00:07:01,740 --> 00:07:02,100
No...

150
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:05,340
I'm ready for a room of my own.

151
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,700
Make it really cool, okay?

152
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:08,300
Ryo-san

153
00:07:08,300 --> 00:07:09,400
Certainly.

154
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:11,360
Junpei, Kappei, young master.

155
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:13,640
Two six-mat rooms

156
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,340
And as for your budget,

157
00:07:15,340 --> 00:07:16,220
Big brother,

158
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:17,640
please.

159
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,640
Here it comes!

160
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,640
500 yen.

161
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:25,440
A 500-yen remodel?

162
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,580
I can't even imagine it.

163
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,600
If you think about the publicity value,

164
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:39,580
let's make this a success together, shall we? But 500 yen?
It's not like we're a charity. Alright, I'll take it on as a loss-leader special.

165
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:41,960
Eeeeh! Boss, that's great!

166
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:45,320
Noooo! Ima-san!

167
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:50,560
I'd also like you to do Gonta's place,
Gonta... ahhhh!

168
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:55,320
This is a doghouse remodel.
You'll give it your all, right?

169
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,400
Fine, fine, I'll do it.

170
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,700
The much-loved remodeling special!

171
00:08:02,700 --> 00:08:04,260
Reborn through remodeling!

172
00:08:04,260 --> 00:08:06,800
Today we bring you the Yamanaka feature.

173
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:07,380
It's starting.

174
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:10,880
A remodeling company has appeared that
works based on what customers like!

175
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,600
Looks like today's going to be promising.

176
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:16,120
Now, joining us today from the
remodeling company is President Kiyama,

177
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,760
Hello.

178
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,560
and sales rep Mr. Ryotsu.

179
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,620
I'm Ryotsu from Kiyama Remodeling.

180
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:24,060
Kiyama-san is so nervous.

181
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,640
It feels a little different from usual,
doesn't it?

182
00:08:26,640 --> 00:08:28,480
Mr. Yamanaka, how are you feeling right now?

183
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,800
My heart is already pounding.

184
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:33,880
And now, the moment you meet
the renovated Yamanaka-sō!

185
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,400
This is

186
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:38,420
From today, Yamanaka-sō is renamed

187
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,700
Maison de Versailles Urban Yamanaka

188
00:08:41,700 --> 00:08:43,740
So, s'il vous plaît!

189
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,540
Versailles!

190
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:48,400
Changing it this much for
just 100,000 yen is amazing.

191
00:08:48,400 --> 00:08:51,380
That's the miracle technique
of Kiyama Remodeling.

192
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,000
It has perspective drawings.

193
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,560
It looks just like the real thing.

194
00:08:58,560 --> 00:09:00,840
Due to budget constraints,
this time we had art college students

195
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:03,080
help us with the design.

196
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,440
There's also a parking lot out back.

197
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,520
Here it is.

198
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:10,240
Lots of really fancy cars!

199
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:12,240
I thought so, but these too

200
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:16,640
I think these luxury cars
serve their purpose well enough.

201
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:17,620
Amazing.

202
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:21,400
We've completely eliminated all the cheap,
shabby feel of a budget apartment.

203
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:24,340
This is the room door.

204
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:30,100
I can hardly believe this
used to be a cheap apartment.

205
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:33,540
This is the closet, and the inside
is very ordinary and down-to-earth.

206
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:36,440
There are also various
rooms with different themes.

207
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:40,080
For example,
this room's theme is nouveau riche.

208
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:43,940
If you dropped the real thing,
you couldn't tell the difference.

209
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:47,100
For those who get lonely easily,
this room is for you.

210
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:48,320
What a huge crowd!

211
00:09:48,320 --> 00:09:50,780
We've brought the bustle of
Shinjuku into the interior design.

212
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:53,680
This is a room where you're always
being watched over by someone.

213
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:58,160
Hey, it'll take a little
while to get used to it.

214
00:09:58,160 --> 00:09:59,300
Wow, amazing.

215
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:02,480
Wow, how interesting!

216
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,080
It's made of cardboard.

217
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:06,700
This might become a hot topic

218
00:10:06,700 --> 00:10:08,640
That's such a Ryo-chan idea, isn't it?

219
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,500
That's just the start.

220
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:11,180
Ryo-chan.

221
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:13,360
But I just saw you on TV.

222
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,100
Of course it's a recording, you idiot.

223
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:19,100
Yes, this is Kiyama Remodeling.

224
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,980
The landlord of Versailles.

225
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:24,820
What, the apartment has
found tenants for every room?

226
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:28,560
But what about Mr. Kiyama's company,
the most important part?

227
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,980
That's the problem, isn't it.

228
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:33,180
Thank you for the splendid doghouse.

229
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,260
Well, as soon as the
remodeling campaign ended,

230
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:37,760
the customers dried up, just like that.

231
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,820
At this rate, instead of making a profit,

232
00:10:39,820 --> 00:10:43,300
we won't even be able to pay back the
debts that piled up from the campaign.

233
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,960
Taking a loss to gain later
is the basic rule of business.

234
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,260
The name Kiyama Remodeling
has spread across the country.

235
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:49,820
This is where the real game begins.

236
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:51,960
Hey, Ryo-san, I can trust you, right?

237
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:53,120
Hello.

238
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:54,840
Welcome.

239
00:10:55,780 --> 00:10:57,820
The campaign's already over?

240
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,060
Unfortunately,

241
00:10:59,060 --> 00:11:01,160
What a shame. Guess we'll head home then.

242
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:02,880
Please wait.

243
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:04,740
You're the guy from TV.

244
00:11:04,740 --> 00:11:06,100
Consultations are free.

245
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:08,960
By the way,
what kind of remodel did you have in mind?

246
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:10,980
My room's cramped, so if at all possible,

247
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,020
I'd like to make it bigger.

248
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:13,660
Let's make it bigger.

249
00:11:13,660 --> 00:11:15,080
Ryo-san.

250
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:16,980
It'll really get bigger?

251
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:17,940
Of course.

252
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:19,040
Ryo-san.

253
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:20,300
Excuse me for a moment.

254
00:11:20,300 --> 00:11:20,960
Hey,

255
00:11:20,960 --> 00:11:21,280
Hey, hey.

256
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:25,120
Ryo-san

257
00:11:25,860 --> 00:11:28,240
Liars are the first step
toward becoming thieves.

258
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,920
If word gets out that we swindled
customers to make a living,

