Shūringan, shūringan no

512
00:25:02,260 --> 00:25:04,400
Gūrindai, gūrindai no

513
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:06,340
Ponpoko Hero, Ponpokonā's

514
00:25:06,340 --> 00:25:08,100
Super Ultimate Jōsuke!

515
00:25:16,860 --> 00:25:19,360
I got candy that turns me back into a kid!

516
00:25:19,720 --> 00:25:22,780
Now I can play every day without working!

517
00:25:22,780 --> 00:25:25,040
