518
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:28,620
I'm a full-of-energy,
slightly mischievous little boy.

519
00:25:28,620 --> 00:25:31,960
Next time, little Ryo-chan, see you then!

520
00:25:33,780 --> 00:25:35,940
Over there is Kameari-ii!

521
00:25:36,860 --> 00:25:38,920
Surely Kameari!

522
00:25:38,920 --> 00:25:44,320
Everybody, come on over to our town!

523
00:25:45,180 --> 00:25:45,900
Thank you!

